/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 83 0 R
/E (Participants are required to design and develop an interactive game or application that simulates the operation of a lunar or Martian outpost. The project should allow users to experience the challenges of managing a space settlement while making decisions about essential resources and systems, including life support, radiation protection, power management and food production. The aim is to create an engaging educational experience that helps younger audiences understand the complexities of sustaining human life beyond Earth.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
